  │  KimRity — Arch + Hyprland security workstation     │
  └─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘

  Install to disk (WARNING: the disk will be wiped):

      bash /root/install.sh --disk /dev/vda --efi

  Contents of /root:
      install.sh     installer (10 steps, with guards)
      dotfiles/      Hyprland, kitty, waybar, bash_profile
      hardening/     auditd rules, sysctl, sshd
      tools/         BlackArch arsenal lists + repo setup
      gate/          Security Gate CLI (scanner configs)
      lab/           artifact #1 (SSH brute-force rule + report + evidence)

  Installed by install.sh into /usr/local/bin: kimrity-gate, kimscan.

  After installing: set your own passwords, then reboot.
